Mainline Linux for the Lenovo Legion Tab Gen 5 / Legion Y700 5th Gen (TB323FU).
An independent community project, not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored
by Lenovo, Qualcomm or Valve. Their names are used only to identify the device
and the software it works with; see TRADEMARKS.md.


