Third-party code
----------------

- Kernel patches imported from upstream, linux-next, the qcom tree and the
  community trees keep their original authors, copyright lines and
  Signed-off-by trailers; kernel/PROVENANCE.md lists the origin of each.
- kernel/out-of-tree/aw882xx/: AWINIC Technology Co., Ltd., copied from
  rockchip-linux/kernel (develop-6.1).
- userspace/platform/udev-override/90-feedbackd.rules: adapted from feedbackd
  (LGPL-2.1-or-later).
- userspace/desktop/steam/steam-arm64: an independent reimplementation; the
  procedure follows ROCKNIX's "Install Steam" script (no code copied).
  https://github.com/ROCKNIX/distribution/blob/next/projects/ROCKNIX/packages/virtual/emulators/sources/Install%20Steam.sh


Not included
------------

- Firmware. No Lenovo or Qualcomm firmware is stored in this repository or in
  its releases; it is extracted from the user's own device (firmware/).
- Valve's Steam client and runtime, the SteamOS-ARM image and distribution
  base images are downloaded on the user's machine by the builders and are
  not redistributed here.
- The screenshots show third-party logos, wallpapers and user interfaces
  (GNOME, Fedora, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, NixOS, Steam). Those elements belong to
  their owners and are not covered by this project's licenses.
